posts.t:
Nice trades mate. This is a style of trading which eludes me really, I'm quite poor at jumping in on a move already in progress, I do much much better on FTB to important reaction levels, since I can usually pinpoint the exact turn level to within a few pips.

Although I will definitely look out for this "return to DP to break engulfing swing high/low before price has reached TG" setup (of course as always being aware that nothing is an inviolate rule in the markets

)

